  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your eidolon is a spirit bound to the land. A kami eidolon's appearance is as varied as the spirits are, and can appear as humanoids, animals, objects, and many other forms. While most kami choose to ward a specific place, you've earned the favor of these spirits enough to harness this bond.</p><p><strong>Tradition</strong> Primal</p><p><strong>Traits</strong> eidolon, kami, spirit</p><p><strong>Home Plane</strong> the Universe</p><hr /><p><strong>Size</strong> Medium or Small</p><p><strong>Suggested Attacks</strong> fist (bludgeoning), spade (slashing), staff (bludgeoning), katana (slashing)</p><p><strong>Eidolon Attributes</strong> <em>Con</em> +1, <em>Int</em> -1, <em>Wis</em> +3, <em>Cha</em> +0</p><p><strong>Skills</strong> Nature, Religion</p><p><strong>Senses</strong> low-light vision</p><p><strong>Language</strong> one common language</p><p><strong>Speed</strong> 25 feet</p><hr /><p><strong>Initial (1st) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.zxnMuV3iEEeCqxVg]{Kami Ward}</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span></p><p><strong>Symbiosis (7th) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.aTGzqv6fkQVrzJUA]{Warded Regeneration}</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span></p><p><strong>Transcendence (17th) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.mc5ZBhAy47eDqrFq]{Bloom and Wilt}</strong></p><hr /><p>The summoner's half of this eidolon is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.summons-unleashed.Item.ojbmxjDmGOTlh8qU]{Kami Eidolon} in the Summons Unleashed compendium.</p>"
